# vergeio_group (Resource)

Creates a group in VergeOS. `name`, `description`, and `enabled` are the group's own fields. Membership stays on `vergeio_member`, and rights stay on `vergeio_permission`.

`vergeio_member.group` is a number. Use `tonumber(vergeio_group.example.id)` when the member should follow this group.

