## Schema

### Required

- `name` (String) Group name. Must be unique.

### Optional

- `description` (String) Group description. Omit to leave an existing description unchanged.
- `enabled` (Boolean) Whether the group is enabled. Omit to leave the current value unchanged.

### Read-Only

- `id` (String) Group key assigned by VergeOS.

## Import

Import is supported using the group key.

```shell
terraform import vergeio_group.example <id>
```
